<title>PHILIPPINES: URC Q1 net up at 313.162 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>URC Q1 net up at 313.162 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first quarter ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per share (pesos)  0.21 vs 0.21</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    2.519 vs 2.095</p>
<p>    Net income			313.162 vs 309.816</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Universal Robina Corp (URC), a food unit of holding firm JG Summit Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
